			"description": "<ul><li>The application is structured around meeting rooms, each identified by a unique ID</li><li>A user can create a new room by navigating to the application's root URL, which generates a unique ID using the 'uuid' library and redirects them</li><li>Other participants can join the meeting simply by opening the same URL containing the room ID</li><li>The server maintains a roster of users for each 'roomID' to manage connections</li></ul>",
