			"description": "<ul><li>Instead of a traditional grid layout, this application places participants in a 2D virtual space</li><li>Each user's video is encapsulated in a circular 'StyledNode' component</li><li>These nodes are positioned absolutely on the screen based on 'x' and 'y' coordinates</li><li>Upon joining, users are assigned a random position within the defined stage dimensions, creating a '2D Meeting' feel</li></ul>",
